 "remarks": "Beautiful Just Renovated 2 bedroom, 1 bathroom apartment located in the Cove! This newly renovated apartment features a stunning kitchen with quartz countertops and stainless steel appliances, large living room with hardwood floors, as well as a beautiful bathroom with tiled walls. The bedrooms are spacious and come with custom closets, providing plenty of storage space. High efficiency heating and lighting! Assigned private parking and laundry in the building make life even easier for you. You'll love the peaceful and secluded location of this apartment. Water, landscaping, trash and snow removal are all included. Conveniently located close to downtown, beaches, parks, train station and Chelsea piers. Pets and smoking are not allowed. This unit is a Must see!! Photos are prior to current tenant .",
